{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Relief 是一款能將你 Apple Watch 或 iPhone 已記錄的戶外運動，自動轉化為獨一無二金屬紀念幣的 App。它會讀取健康資料中的戶外散步、跑步、健行、單車與滑雪紀錄，並以當日的海拔變化曲線製成硬幣，極具視覺吸引力與紀念價值，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>無需操作自動記錄</h2>\n<p>這款 App 完全無需啟動或追蹤。所有戶外運動資料已儲存於健康資料庫中，Relief 就像一座自動運作的鑄幣廠，會讀取海拔高度數據而非步數，將每次攀升與下降的輪廓捲成戒指狀的硬幣邊緣。每一枚硬幣的形狀都反映當天的實際地形起伏，極具個人化特色。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-516-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-517-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-518-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-519-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-520-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Relief: Every Climb in Metal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T06:25:40.756261+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}